<title>USA: Geneva Cty BOE, Ala., won by Joe Jolly.</title>
<headline>Geneva Cty BOE, Ala., won by Joe Jolly.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joe Jolly &amp; Co. said it won $1.235 million of Geneva Cty BOE, Ala., capital outlay tax anticipation warrants, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.57 percent.</p>
</text>
